<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenGetStatus</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to determine the kind of value a token
    represents</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">enum SilikoTokenStatus SilikoTokenGetStatus(
    const SilikoToken *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenGetStatus</function> function gets the
status of <varname>object</varname>. The status can be used to determine
which kind of value the token holds.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoTokenGetStatus</function> returns the status
  of <varname>object</varname>. If <varname>object</varname> is
  <literal>NULL</literal>, then
  <function>SilikoTokenGetStatus</function> returns
  <literal>SilikoTokenUnset</literal>.</para>
</refsection>
